WEBVTT

00:00:03.206 --> 00:00:07.340
To read the folder right away, open the Actions menu of the source

00:00:07.340 --> 00:00:08.776
and click Read now.

00:00:09.229 --> 00:00:13.647
After a moment, the Last run column shows what happened:

00:00:13.647 --> 00:00:18.849
how many files were found, ingested, unchanged, removed and failed.

00:00:19.304 --> 00:00:22.032
Here all three files were ingested.

00:00:22.032 --> 00:00:27.224
From now on, the schedule keeps the data source in step with the folder.

